---
const examplesHref = '/getting-started/examples/';
const githubBase = 'https://github.com/phucnht/texchanges/tree/main/examples';
---

<section class="example-cards" aria-labelledby="example-cards-title">
  <div class="example-cards__heading">
    <p class="tx-eyebrow">% examples</p>
    <h2 id="example-cards-title">Choose a review workflow</h2>
    <p>Start with explicit markup when decisions belong in one source file, or compare two complete revisions with automatic <code>latexdiff</code>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="example-cards__grid">
    <article class="example-card">
      <img src="/examples/explicit-review-review.png" alt="Explicit review example with marked changes and a review report." loading="lazy" />
      <div class="example-card__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Semantic source markup</p>
        <h3>Explicit review</h3>
        <p>Use author IDs, statuses, comments, and reports while compiling the same document in review, final, or original mode.</p>
        <p class="example-card__actions">
          <a href={examplesHref}>View examples <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href={`${githubBase}/explicit-review/`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open GitHub example <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="example-card">
      <img src="/examples/automatic-diff-review.png" alt="Automatic latexdiff example with removed and added text marked visually." loading="lazy" />
      <div class="example-card__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Revision-to-revision comparison</p>
        <h3>Automatic <code>latexdiff</code></h3>
        <p>Generate a visual PDF comparison from earlier and later LaTeX revisions through an Overleaf-ready <code>latexmkrc</code> workflow.</p>
        <p class="example-card__actions">
          <a href={examplesHref}>View examples <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href={`${githubBase}/automatic-diff/`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open GitHub example <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
